        "text": "Base rate/reference class: the recent official-source base rate is a high-level, slow-moving national caseload around 41.7 to 42.3 million persons, with May-to-May moves of -0.353 million from 2023 to 2024 and +0.460 million from 2024 to 2025 rather than a clear trend."
